---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/urls';
---
<BaseLayout title="Our philosophy | CookDance" description="Cooking is a philosophy. Discover the idea behind CookDance and get in touch.">
  <section class="about-hero container"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href={withBase('/')}>Home</a><span>/</span><span>About</span></div><span class="kicker">A PERSONAL NOTE</span><h1>Cooking is<br /><em>a philosophy.</em></h1><p class="about-original" lang="zh-CN">cook其实是一种哲学。</p><p>Cooking invites us to observe, make choices, and learn through everyday practice. That curiosity is at the heart of CookDance—and the way we explore ingredients, techniques, and life around food.</p></section>
  <section class="about-content container"><div><span class="kicker">WHAT WE BELIEVE</span><h2>Understand Food.<br />Enjoy Cooking.</h2></div><div><p>We start with the questions behind the steps: What is the ingredient doing? Why this technique? Which tool actually helps? The answers turn instructions into understanding.</p><p>Our ambition is a clear, welcoming place to learn the fundamentals, explore food culture, and discover practical recipes. Content that involves testing will be labeled accurately as the library grows.</p><a class="button button-dark" href={withBase('/learn')}>Start exploring <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="contact-section container" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
    <div class="contact-intro"><span class="kicker">GET IN TOUCH</span><h2 id="contact-title">Let’s talk food.</h2><p>A question, a shared idea, or a conversation about cooking. You’re welcome to get in touch.</p></div>
    <div class="contact-links">
      <a class="contact-link" href="mailto:boehnerhuang@gmail.com"><span class="contact-label">EMAIL</span><span class="contact-value">boehnerhuang@gmail.com</span><span class="contact-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a class="contact-link" href="https://wa.me/8613612993822" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="contact-label">WHATSAPP</span><span class="contact-value">+86 136 1299 3822</span><span class="contact-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
